{"name": "The Da Vinci Cryptex", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/extras_big/2581252718d3e1903bbc6afe706ae229.avif?t=1785761345\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/extras/2581252718d3e1903bbc6afe706ae229.avif?t=1785761345\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Trapped in a room of the Italian genial inventor, you need to think out of the box to solve logical enigmas written in a book and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the answers, unlock the Cryptex, and see what awaits you in the next room! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/extras_big/2b0a90da73c60269f160456469d75d80.avif?t=1785761345\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/extras/2b0a90da73c60269f160456469d75d80.avif?t=1785761345\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Da Vinci Cryptex</strong> is a brainteasing game consisting of 50 unique riddles; the more you go on, the harder the puzzles become</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So, how many puzzles will you crack?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warning: this IQ game may be addictive!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/extras_big/ee7610421e295c8adb2f149a558411fe.avif?t=1785761345\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/extras/ee7610421e295c8adb2f149a558411fe.avif?t=1785761345\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a050 unique handcrafted puzzles </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hints available (click the bulb button to get a hint) </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Astonishing graphics\u2211</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Captivating background music</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you're a fan of puzzles, word games, brain thinking, mind games, logic riddles, and enigmas, The Da Vinci Cryptex is the game for you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/extras_big/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785761345\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/extras/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785761345\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2> </div>", "short_desc": "The Da Vinci Cryptex is an atmospheric point-and-click escape room puzzle adventure. Step into Leonardo da Vinci's workshop, inspect intricate drawings, and solve challenging logic riddles to escape!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/17dac597a2c91acfc82f4cf11e8a6ed44807120e/header.jpg?t=1785761345", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Strategy", "Software", "Board Game", "Point & Click", "Puzzle"], "developers": "XSGames", "publishers": "XSGames", "release_date": "Nov 8, 2023", "price": "$3.99", "appid": "2666270", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "10 May 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/JCONm0z2FRA", "first_seen": 1746835200.0, "rev